  "description": "A tiger that is stupid and timid and cannot stand the weight of its size. After eavesdropping on the conversations of humans, he mistakes 'dried persimmons' for scary monsters, and when he encounters a thief in the dark, he mistakes him for 'dried persimmons' and faints. The cunning thief who finds the precious tiger seal dreams of making a fortune through 'tiger trade'!\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Jeollaeyahandonghwa (전래야한동화) Collection.*",
